OL,3,GNEWSAStalking law simplified to become 
OL,4,Aone offence                            
OL,6,FA review was ordered by the government 
OL,7,Flast year, led by Richard Wright KC,   
OL,8,Fwho prosecuted the man who stalked and 
OL,9,Fmurdered Alice Ruggles in Gateshead in 
OL,10,F2016.                                  
OL,12,FVictims of stalking have welcomed the  
OL,13,Fchange in law but said they were       
OL,14,Fdisappointed not all the               
OL,15,Frecommendations have been adopted.     
